# D-TAPESEARCH: CLOAD / CLOAD? searching past the files on a tape
{TCL cassetteplayer new {TMP}_tape.wav}
NEW
10 PRINT "ONE"
CSAVE "PROG1"
SAVE "CAS:PROG2"
CSAVE "PROG3"
{TCL cassetteplayer rewind}
CLOAD "PROG1"
CLOAD "PROG3"
LIST
{TCL cassetteplayer rewind}
CLOAD "PROG1"
CLOAD? "NOSUCH"
{WAIT 15}
{STOP}
PRINT "AFTER"
